  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>81</mn><mi>t</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>30</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>81</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mn>81</mn></mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>1</mn></msup></math>&nbsp; or&nbsp;&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>3</mn><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>&nbsp; or&nbsp; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0046_c856a7ecd790.png\" style=\"width: 248px; height: 114px;\" />&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Hence, total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> solution.</p>"
